# (build 166) LANGUAGE changed during the attract crawl: the crawl's
# script, dropped with the banks, read again in the new language. Until
# 166 the message box was gone for the rest of the crawl.
start new
wait screen level
wait script $1402
wait ticks 30
language ja
wait ticks 2
expect pixel 172 150 $EEE      # the mark over ゴ (lang_ja_crawl's)
shot 01_japanese
